(text "Build 10 copies; no active components or power supply.\nPOWER and RESET each pass through to original case switch with a parallel remote branch.\nOriginal PLED/HDD cables stay directly on the motherboard and do not enter this adapter.\nPin 9: separately verified motherboard ground for button ESD. Pins 5..8 and 10 unused."(at 12 20 0)(effects(font(size 1.27 1.27))(justify left))(uuid b186c5f0-d2c4-582f-8b5a-9c48f431ab37))
